# PostHog anonymous usage analytics.
# Leave empty to run Swift with analytics disabled — the app no-ops cleanly
# without a key, so this file works as-is for local development.
# Real key goes in .env (gitignored), never here.
VITE_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
# The host is fixed to https://us.i.posthog.com in src/lib/posthog.ts and vercel.json (CSP).
